  ('ai-literacy','q7',1,'Unauthorised help in an exam is cheating whether or not you are caught, and it risks serious penalties.'),
  ('ai-literacy','q8',2,'Where use is permitted, being open about it protects your integrity and follows good practice.'),
  ('ai-literacy','q9',3,'Personal information can be stored or seen, and the other person has not agreed to share it. Anonymise or leave it out.'),
  ('ai-literacy','q10',0,'PINs and codes are secrets that give access to your money, and tools do not need them to help you.'),
  ('ai-literacy','q11',1,'Tools can repeat stereotypes in their training data. Noticing it and seeking diverse perspectives is the sensible approach.'),
